## leather glove takes a thing lying or plucks by hand, a sword strikes with
## its point where it will hit, an axe chops, a pick digs, a bow's sight
## shoots, a hammer works at a workbench or a forge; else the corners of a
## square. Drawn as pixel art in the raster's pixels (ADR-0022) and scaled
## with them, outlined so it shows on any ground.

